## Output format

End your reply with a single fenced code block containing ONLY a YAML
object with exactly these fields:

```yaml
reasoning: |
  <what the evidence says is uncovered and why these bullets>
additions:
  - section: pitfalls
    content: |
      <the bullet>
    references:
      - <a Rocq object it relies on; [] if none>
    classes: [ring-failure]
    names: []
    patterns: ['\bring\b']
    goal_patterns: ['<=|<']
    rationale: |
      <one line: which evidence group this covers>
```

Write every `content`, `reasoning` and `rationale` as a YAML block
scalar (`|`), never a plain scalar: bullets contain Rocq snippets with
`: ` in them. Quote every regular expression as a YAML single-quoted
string so backslashes survive. The code block must be the last thing
in your message.
